#!/usr/bin/python3
"""kioskd -- root-side backend of the kiosk (stdlib only).

Serves the Settings/Installer page and a JSON API on 127.0.0.1:8088 for
anything needing root: Wi-Fi/IP, HMI address, bootc updates, ISO install.
Guards against other pages (the HMI included): /api requires "X-Kiosk: 1"
(foreign origins would need a CORS preflight, never answered), and Host must
be 127.0.0.1:8088 / localhost:8088 (DNS rebinding).
"""

